  <div class="post-body about-body">
    <img class="about-portrait" src="/images/kyaro-pfp.png" alt="Kyaro" />
    <p class="lede">Hello, I'm Kyaro, or Karol.</p>
    <p>
      This is my tiny corner of the internet, dedicated for my creative
      expression as Kyaro. It's supposed to be personal, real to my sensitive
      self. I am a shy person, but I hope that my thoughts, imagination and
      ideas may bring enjoyment or happiness to other people, be it through my
      videos, photography or blog posts and articles. I love keeping an
      attention to details of everyday life, and finding joy in little things,
      some that may be unnoticed, or even considered a hurdle by most of
      society — this is what I hope to capture and stop keeping just to myself,
      hidden away in my imagination.
    </p>
    <p>
      Not everything here may follow a strict pattern, conform to one idea or
      area of interest. I wish to write about my life, the games I play, my
      travels, sudden thoughts, psychology, the internet and many other things.
      Read whatever catches your interest — I hope you'll find something for
      yourself here.
    </p>
    <p><em>(More about me in the coming blog posts and other parts — growing a website takes time.)</em></p>

    <p>Thanks for stopping by. You can find me doing other stuff, and ways to support me, on the <a href="/links/">Links</a> page.</p>
  </div>
